{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/328fae56e19f402375f3201276fcd09c.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/328fae56e19f402375f3201276fcd09c.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/328fae56e19f402375f3201276fcd09c.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shards of Order</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG with card-based combat, set in a decaying world where reality itself is unraveling. The ancient Laws that once bound life, death, and time have been stolen or shattered, leaving behind a place where memory fades, identity fractures, and even the dead refuse to stay buried. Uncover the story of a grim, shattered world by exploring its hidden corners and shaping its fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It\u2019s up to you to restore the Order\u2014if you decide it\u2019s worth saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/e2ee7d0f39a2a9967890601e5ef9302f.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/e2ee7d0f39a2a9967890601e5ef9302f.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/e2ee7d0f39a2a9967890601e5ef9302f.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A group of resilient survivors embarks on a final journey to piece the world back together, one shattered Law at a time. Choose from <strong>five distinct playable characters</strong>, each with multiple playstyles, different abilities, and personal arcs. Combine their strengths to form a party built for survival, synergy, and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/b68abf6412d40349518c44a6b61cb008.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/b68abf6412d40349518c44a6b61cb008.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/b68abf6412d40349518c44a6b61cb008.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shards of Order is not just a deckbuilder\u2014it\u2019s a <strong>true RPG.</strong> Develop your characters through <strong>leveling up, skill trees, equipment customization, dialogue choices, </strong>and <strong>skill checks.</strong> Weapons and armor are a vital part of buildcrafting. They define each hero\u2019s playstyle, granting passive abilities and adding unique cards to your shared deck. With only one set of cards across your party, every choice brings impactful trade-offs and gameplay alterations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/2be2ef93f71cf317a4d8a48a579858f0.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/2be2ef93f71cf317a4d8a48a579858f0.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/2be2ef93f71cf317a4d8a48a579858f0.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are no regular turns or mana points. Shards of Order replaces the standard turn-based formula with a <strong>dynamic time counter system.</strong> Every enemy has a countdown indicating their next move. Every card you play reduces those counters and alters the flow of battle. This requires you to plan your moves strategically. Misjudge the timing, and your entire party could fall. <strong>Time</strong> is your most valuable resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/c9efadb8c0e7ddbf08323752d190f84c.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/c9efadb8c0e7ddbf08323752d190f84c.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/c9efadb8c0e7ddbf08323752d190f84c.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore <strong>three unique regions,</strong> each steeped in decay, mystery, and the last echoes of order. Face <strong>epic, hand-crafted boss battles</strong> that demand more than brute force. These encounters test your deck, your timing, and your understanding of each hero\u2019s role. Victory isn\u2019t guaranteed; you\u2019ll have to earn it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/d55812b5d39455d1e83780f92642f4e8.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/d55812b5d39455d1e83780f92642f4e8.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/d55812b5d39455d1e83780f92642f4e8.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you scavenge through the remnants of a dying world, you\u2019ll begin to uncover and restore <strong>the lost Laws</strong> that once governed existence. But these Laws do not offer comfort. They bring <strong>game-changing consequences</strong>, twisting the rules in ways both brutal and rewarding. Each Law restored deepens the systems at play, opening new strategies and enhancing your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Embark on a journey through ruin, where every decision leaves a scar, and every scar becomes part of your story. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>There is no order.\u00a0 Only what you are strong enough to bring back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432480?t=1770742125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/96b23a08422234b8be13d74a2bb38c9b857fcb95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770742125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/921307ff3de4a27c441ef6368b06fecc411d6e57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770742125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/921307ff3de4a27c441ef6368b06fecc411d6e57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770742125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3672010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/328fae56e19f402375f3201276fcd09c.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/328fae56e19f402375f3201276fcd09c.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/328fae56e19f402375f3201276fcd09c.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shards of Order</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG with card-based combat, set in a decaying world where reality itself is unraveling. The ancient Laws that once bound life, death, and time have been stolen or shattered, leaving behind a place where memory fades, identity fractures, and even the dead refuse to stay buried. Uncover the story of a grim, shattered world by exploring its hidden corners and shaping its fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It\u2019s up to you to restore the Order\u2014if you decide it\u2019s worth saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic