ue cards to your shared deck. With only one set of cards across your party, every choice brings impactful trade-offs and gameplay alterations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/2be2ef93f71cf317a4d8a48a579858f0.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/2be2ef93f71cf317a4d8a48a579858f0.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/2be2ef93f71cf317a4d8a48a579858f0.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are no regular turns or mana points. Shards of Order replaces the standard turn-based formula with a <strong>dynamic time counter system.</strong> Every enemy has a countdown indicating their next move. Every card you play reduces those counters and alters the flow of battle. This requires you to plan your moves strategically. Misjudge the timing, and your entire party could fall. <strong>Time</strong> is your most valuable resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/c9efadb8c0e7ddbf08323752d190f84c.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/c9efadb8c0e7ddbf08323752d190f84c.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/c9efadb8c0e7ddbf08323752d190f84c.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore <strong>three unique regions,</strong> each steeped in decay, mystery, and the last echoes of order. Face <strong>epic, hand-crafted boss battles</strong> that demand more than brute force. These encounters test your deck, your timing, and your understanding of each hero\u2019s role. Victory isn\u2019t guaranteed; you\u2019ll have to earn it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/d55812b5d39455d1e83780f92642f4e8.poster.avif?t=1770742125\" width=700 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/d55812b5d39455d1e83780f92642f4e8.webm?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432480/extras/d55812b5d39455d1e83780f92642f4e8.mp4?t=1770742125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you scavenge through the remnants of a dying world, you\u2019ll begin to uncover and restore <strong>the lost Laws</strong> that once governed existence. But these Laws do not offer comfort. They bring <strong>game-changing consequences</strong>, twisting the rules in ways both brutal and rewarding. Each Law restored deepens the systems at play, opening new strategies and enhancing your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Embark on a journey through ruin, where every decision leaves a scar, and every scar becomes part of your story. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>There is no order.\u00a0 Only what you are strong enough to bring back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 